WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.377
♪

00:00:02.377 --> 00:00:04.087
Ty: Do you know what the greatest thing about America is?

00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:04.921
♪

00:00:04.921 --> 00:00:07.382
Ty: You can make things happen here like no where else.

00:00:07.382 --> 00:00:08.925
♪

00:00:08.925 --> 00:00:11.720
Ty: You have the power to create your own future.

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:12.387
♪

00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:14.848
Ty: You can be anything. You can do anything.

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:16.057
♪

00:00:16.057 --> 00:00:17.100
Employee: You want to sell

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.936
high end stuffed Himalayan cats?

00:00:19.936 --> 00:00:22.397
Ty: Under stuffed actually, for greater possibility.

00:00:22.397 --> 00:00:23.398
Robbie: We’re professionals,

00:00:23.398 --> 00:00:24.816
we’re giving the people what they need.

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:33.032
♪

00:00:33.032 --> 00:00:34.159
Ty: Did you see the latest numbers?

00:00:34.159 --> 00:00:35.785
We broke the entire internet thing!

00:00:35.785 --> 00:00:37.871
♪

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:38.997
Ty: You go big

00:00:38.997 --> 00:00:40.415
or you go home!

00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:41.374
[CHEERING]

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:43.084
♪

00:00:43.084 --> 00:00:44.794
Robbie: Ty would tell you he did it all

00:00:44.794 --> 00:00:45.879
[GASPS]

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:47.297
♪

00:00:47.297 --> 00:00:48.381
Robbie: Which is as crazy as

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:50.842
Robbie: believing stuffed animals are gold.

00:00:50.842 --> 00:00:52.010
[TIRES SCREECHING]

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:53.011
Ty: Did you see the truck crash?

00:00:53.011 --> 00:00:54.179
[BANG]

00:00:54.179 --> 00:00:55.263
[HONKING]

00:00:55.263 --> 00:00:55.930
Insane.

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:57.056
[LAUGHTER]

00:00:57.056 --> 00:00:57.932
Poor beanies.

00:00:57.932 --> 00:01:00.143
♪

00:01:00.143 --> 00:01:02.145
Ty: This has always been my company.

00:01:02.145 --> 00:01:04.689
A company we created together.

00:01:04.689 --> 00:01:06.274
Why do you have to be dramatic, I mean?

00:01:06.274 --> 00:01:08.401
My salary’s been reduced 75 percent.

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:10.236
Yeah I’m just doing what’s necessary.

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:13.072
You know, running the real actual business over here.

00:01:13.072 --> 00:01:16.701
♪

00:01:16.701 --> 00:01:17.786
Maya: My life is this company.

00:01:17.786 --> 00:01:18.620
Maya: I see where it’s going.

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:20.163
♪

00:01:20.163 --> 00:01:21.748
Maya: There are signs of real trouble.

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:23.625
Ty: Genius is 1 percent inspiration,

00:01:23.625 --> 00:01:26.920
99 percent presentation.

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:28.755
That’s not how the saying goes.

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:29.506
[GROANS]

00:01:29.506 --> 00:01:31.925
♪

00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:33.343
Ty: Everything good that’s happened to me

00:01:33.343 --> 00:01:34.552
Ty: is because of you guys.

00:01:34.552 --> 00:01:36.596
Ty: We are bonded forever.

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:39.516
♪

00:01:39.516 --> 00:01:41.351
Have you considered poisoning him?

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:44.437
Countless times.

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:53.571
♪

00:01:53.571 --> 00:01:54.280
[LAUGHING]

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:55.365
♪

00:01:55.365 --> 00:01:57.325
Ty: I have our perfect partners lined up

00:01:57.325 --> 00:01:58.159
Jehovah’s witnesses.

00:01:58.159 --> 00:01:59.911
The greatest 101 salesmen in the world.

00:01:59.911 --> 00:02:00.829
How brilliant is that?

00:02:00.829 --> 00:02:01.538
[EXHALES]

00:02:01.538 --> 00:02:03.957
♪

00:02:03.957 --> 00:02:05.542
Maya: It’s all gonna go boom!

00:02:05.542 --> 00:02:06.835
♪

00:02:06.835 --> 00:02:07.544
You’re dead to me! 

00:02:07.544 --> 00:02:16.010
♪

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:19.514
I only want to speak to Oprah Winfrey.

00:02:19.514 --> 00:02:20.682
Has she reached out?

00:02:20.682 --> 00:02:25.353
♪

